    "customer_review_Ya4aUq": {
      "type": "customer-review",
      "blocks": {
        "quote_zG7wjn": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>\"NuNorm has made self-care so much easier for me.” <em>I switched out my moisturiser for the tinted hydrator. Still keeps my skin hydrated but actually covers up blemishes too.</em></p>",
            "reviewer": "Andre P."
          }
        },
        "quote_iaCPPt": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>\"I finally found products that actually work with my skin and don’t feel heavy.\" <em>Doesn’t feel like I’m wearing anything on my skin.</em></p>",
            "reviewer": "Carlos M."
          }
        },
        "quote_EDfqzk": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>“My biggest concern is someone noticing but it is so lightweight no one can tell” <em>I was worried people would notice, but honestly no one can tell.</em></p>",
            "reviewer": "Malik S."
          }
        },
        "quote_m8Khaw": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>\"Gives me that ‘put-together’ vibe, even on rough mornings.” <em> I work late a lot, and using Quick Cover under my eyes the next morning makes a huge difference.</em></p>",
            "reviewer": "Kenny V."
          }
        },
        "quote_fyyqMc": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>“No heavy feeling, no weird residue. Just looks like me—only fresher.” <em>Not greasy and just looks normal.</em></p>",
            "reviewer": "Omar R."
          }
        },
        "quote_hQE6wk": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>“Small enough to keep in my car, just in case.”</p>",
            "reviewer": "Marcus F."
          }
        },
        "quote_7yNeCX": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>“Finally, something that doesn’t clog my pores or leave me feeling greasy. My skin<br/>actually feels better at the end of the day.” <em>Doesn’t feel heavy in my skin and by the end of the day it still feels fine.</em></p>",
            "reviewer": "Jonah B."
          }
        },
        "quote_xpKraw": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>“I was skeptical, but the Brow Rescue really helps me look more awake—especially for<br/>early meetings.”<em> Didn’t think I’d use it, but it makes me look less tired in the mornings.</em></p>",
            "reviewer": "Sam D."
          }
        },
        "quote_rTjtXf": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>“Desk, gym bag, bathroom—I’ve got one for every spot I might need it.”</p>",
            "reviewer": "Rafael C."
          }
        },
        "quote_nkmfab": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p>“I appreciate that it’s fragrance-free. Most products smell too strong, but this is totally<br/>neutral.”</p>",
            "reviewer": "Oliver H"
          }
        },
        "quote_HC6jzK": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p><em>Before a night out, I always use NuNorm. Helps me feel more confident.</em></p>",
            "reviewer": ""
          }
        },
        "quote_3y3yW8": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p><em>Helps with the Asian blush.</em></p>",
            "reviewer": ""
          }
        },
        "quote_99NCVk": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p><em>I’ve always had sparse brows, I didn’t realise how much of a difference filling them in would make.</em></p>",
            "reviewer": ""
          }
        },
        "quote_FhtwCf": {
          "type": "quote",
          "settings": {
            "quote": "<p><em>Love the brow pencil. I keep one at home, at work, and in my gym bag</em></p>",
            "reviewer": ""
          }
        }
      },
